---
description: Always deploy Fusion Express to Vercel production after shipping user-visible work
alwaysApply: true
---

After implementing or fixing anything that should be on the live app, deploy with `npx --yes vercel@59.3.0 --prod --yes --scope fusion-1468` (do not wait for the user to ask). The only site that matters is https://www.gracerun.fit. Do not alias or deploy to gracerun.vercel.app, servecart.vercel.app, or any other host.
